   1034  2780							; Enemies: half of them each frame (even slots on even frames, odd slots on
   1035  2780							; odd frames), so each moves in steps of two frames. Each walks left at its
   1036  2780							; kind's pace; a toy in its way stops it and gets chewed, except: the
   1037  2780							; helicopter hops over the first toy, the pogo frog jumps to the next shelf
