   1725  2c15							; Sound: channel 0 plays the player's actions and jingles, channel 1 combat.
   1726  2c15							; A sound is a list of steps (ticks of two frames, AUDC*16+AUDV, AUDF) ending
   1727  2c15							; in a zero; a new sound replaces the one playing on its channel unless that
   1728  2c15							; one matters more (SndPri).
   1729  2c15				   SndPlay		; A = sound id; keeps X and Y
   1730  2c15					      SUBROUTINE
